                  <provenance type="#e"><orgName role="fmo" key="org_469">Rochester, Kent.
                        Cathedral priory of St Andrew</orgName><p>'Moralia Gregorii pape per fr.
                        Thomam de Horstede [monachum?] de claustro Roffensi qui de claustro predicto
                        elongauerit vel hunc titulum . . . deleuerit inde proditoris particeps
                        efficiatur dampnabiliter in inferno. fiat fiat amen nec sentiat iden
                        levamen' (fol. 1, erased). The couplet by Thomas Wybarn (Qui servare libris
                        . . .) is on fol. i.</p></provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">'Cowley. Qui timet deum faciat bona' (fol.
